{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16893","headline":"行路难 · 武元衡","name":"行路难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见道旁废井傍开花，原是昔年骄贵家。\n几度美人来照影，濯纤笑引银瓶绠。\n风飘雨散今奈何，绣闼雕甍绿苔多。\n笙歌鼎沸君莫矜，豪奢未必长多金。\n休说编氓朴无耻，至竟终须合天理。\n非故败他却成此，苏张终作多言鬼。\n行路难，路难不在九折湾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}